{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/1234046/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は来てくださったかた\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の会場は\nポートメッセ名古屋で\n全握なのに室内だったから\n日焼けが嫌いな中田歓喜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、ミニライブセトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか？\n涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\n音がでないギター\n自己紹介＆抽選会\nせっかちなかたつむり\n走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抽選会では\n乃木坂のメンバーの現在の人数の\n33個当たりがありました！\n当たった33人のかたおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/1234046/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のばいしくるは全員ver.だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣の会場では\nSKE48さんの全握をやっていたみたいで\n握手会の前に\nSKE48の松井珠理奈さん、松井玲奈さん、高柳明音さんが影ナレで会場を盛り上げてくださいました(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にしても、みなさん沸きすぎです(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いや、中田も沸いたけど←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つづいて、にぎにぎ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第4レーン　さゆにゃん、ゆみ姉、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3ショット撮ろうと思ったのに\nゆみ姉ご飯行っちゃうから\n2人で撮ったよ〜←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪切ったのどうでした？(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングかショートどっちがいいか\nって質問は\nショートが好きとか\nロングも見てみたいとか\n意見が半々に別れたから\n今後の髪型考えときます(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナタリーさんにも\n写真有りでレポ載ってるので\n良かったらみてね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー\n個別も好きだけど\n全握も楽しいね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは大阪個別！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、インテックス大阪でやっていた\n写メ会に行きたかったけど←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたはインテックス大阪で\n中田とのにぎにぎを楽しみましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話すこと無くなったらでいいので\n教えてください(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/1234046/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今一番行きたいところは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/1234046/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近気になりだしたものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはいつもの持ち物チェック！\nまた載せとくね　(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□納品書\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n(□手紙とかプレゼント)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}